   137	"A totally ramified cubic (`e=3` at one point, still `R=2`) has only one
   138	critical image and fails (4.7)."
   139	
   140	That last sentence is the hinge of this lane. REV rejected total ramification as
   141	*one of two* numerically admissible shapes. §4 below shows it is the **only**
