   143	impossible — and the packet therefore has no surviving arrangement.
   144	
   145	### 2.1 The charge's naive count does not close, and why
   146	
   147	The charge proposes: `h_1 : l′ ≅ A¹ → D̃ ≅ A¹` of degree 3 has, by
   148	Riemann–Hurwitz on the projective completions, finite ramification of total
   149	degree `Σ_t (e_t − 1) = s_1 − 1 = 2`; so "16 units cannot sit on a ramification
   150	divisor of total degree 2".
