   275	everywhere, hence `s_l = 1`; so `s_l ≥ 2 ⟹ μ_l ≥ 2`. ∎
   276	
   277	Two remarks fix the scope.
   278	
   279	**(i) Where the two-critical-point picture came from.** REV §4.5 derived "two
   280	distinct simple critical points" *backwards*, from the equality conditions in
