   287	
   288	**(ii) An independent cross-check of Lemma 3.1 not using [R2].** The same
   289	conclusion follows from a direct Jacobian computation, which is worth recording
   290	because it exhibits the mechanism. At a boundary-smooth `t ∈ l′` take `(u,v)`
   291	with `l = {v=0}`, target `(x,y)` with the smooth image branch `{y=0}`. Then
   292	`Y := y∘f` vanishes on `l` to order exactly `μ_l` (the generic local degree), so
