   318	jump at one point.
   319	
   320	## 5. The `corr_l` ceiling: the general inequality
   321	
   322	Throughout: H2, `μ_0 = 1` for some dicritical, hence [P5]; `W = Σ_l s_l μ_l`,
   323	`a = N − W`, `d = 2a − N = a − W > 0` by [P7]. Set
   324	
   325	```text
   326	b  = #{ l : μ_l = 1 },        b ≥ 1
   327	q  = #{ l : μ_l ≥ 2 }
   328	q′ = #{ l : s_l ≥ 2 }        (⊆ the μ_l ≥ 2 set, by Theorem 4.A)
