   342	`e = s_l` colliding parametrization sheets, and the surplus is realized by
   343	affine preimages of points `q ∈ Δ` lying arbitrarily close to the contracted
   344	configuration — i.e. escaping to infinity as `q → p`. Contradiction. Hence
   345	`P ⊆ Σ = Sing D`, and by [P5] every `p ∈ P` is multibranch: `r_p ≥ 2`.
   346	
   347	**(c) Per-image ceiling.** [P7] at `p ∈ P` gives
   348	`K_p = N − r_p W − a_p ≤ N − 2W = d`, using `r_p ≥ 2` from (b) and `a_p ≥ 0`.
   349	
   350	**(d) Global excess.** ALL-N (4.6), CONFIRMED at REV §4.3, gives
   351	`Σ_{p∈Σ} K_p = a − 1`. By (b) no excess sits off `Σ`, so
   352	`Σ_{p∈P} K_p = a − 1`.
