   368	and weight `s_l μ_l = 1`; each `l` with `μ_l ≥ 2, s_l = 1` has weight `≥ 2`;
   369	each of the `q′` carriers has `μ_l, s_l ≥ 2` and weight `≥ 4`. Hence
   370	
   371	```text
   372	W ≥ b + 2(q − q′) + 4q′ = b + 2q + 2q′ ≥ 1 + 4q′       (since b ≥ 1, q ≥ q′),
   373	```
   374	
   375	so
   376	
   377	```text
   378	q′ ≤ ⌊(W − 1)/4⌋.                                       (5.2)
   379	```
   380	
   381	REV §4.4 verified that the analogous most-generous configuration for `R` is
   382	`b = q = 1`, `μ = 2`; the same check applies here, since adding trivial
   383	dicriticals, adding `μ ≥ 2` non-carriers, or raising any `μ_l` all increase `W`
